  "prefLabel": "Lab 1305.07 Inspection Fees Charged to Owners",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 1305.07 Inspection Fees Charged to Owners.\n\n(a) The department shall charge a minimum of $100.00 for inspections performed by its employees.\n\n(b) Inspections requiring more than one hour shall be charged at the rate of $100.00 per hour calculated in half hour increments.\n\nSource. #14313, eff 7-11-25, EXPIRES: 7-11-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lab1300.html"
